  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling 1220 (2026-10-07, R1017): text operations chain in the order the request names them (OperationVocabulary::position twin)."
